            "body": "> can you put in a screenshot before/after\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Removed the blank line before the first healthcheck header. (Before)</summary>\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c83b1b76-462c-4a5d-9175-63facd827aa7\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Removed the blank line before the first healthcheck header. (After)</summary>\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16803efd-2f60-4e30-b8a9-c4fd0e03f8ae\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Fixed a bug where the entire \"Terminal\" section of `vim.health` would not appear if the `infocmp` executable was not found. (Before)</summary>\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/406e339b-3fde-404f-93cc-86358cbf4a2a\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Fixed a bug where the entire \"Terminal\" section of `vim.health` would not appear if the `infocmp` executable was not found. (After)</summary>\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e165282-d4b1-4f13-90fb-d1ffc799ff7a\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Fixed a typo in `vim.lsp` when displaying the LSP log level. (Before)</summary>\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/663fb15b-dce8-446f-9b16-8b2c22d7fe7d\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Fixed a typo in `vim.lsp` when displaying the LSP log level.  (After)</summary>\r\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"561\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6cf6eca-5256-4d5a-ac33-69f3e3f8eb91\" />\r\n</details>",
